# ---- close-out overdue warn (optional) ----
# bin/orphan-reconcile.sh skips a ticket as awaiting-closeout while one of its
# build dirs has a RESULT and no COMMENTED. Once the oldest such RESULT is older
# than this many seconds, bin/lib/closeout-overdue.sh raises one pipeline-health
# warn per key (id closeout-overdue:<project>:<KEY>). Default 2700 (45m); a
# non-numeric value falls back to 2700 and anything below 600 is raised to 600.
#CLOSEOUT_OVERDUE_S=2700
